{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44772","headline":"送无着禅师归新罗 · 法照","name":"送无着禅师归新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里归乡路，随缘不算程。\n寻山百衲弊，过海一杯轻。\n夜宿依云色，晨斋就水声。\n何年持贝叶，却到汉家城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法照","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}